    "body": "[application/x-www-form-urlencoded percent-encode set](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#application-x-www-form-urlencoded-percent-encode-set) includes [component percent-encode set](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#component-percent-encode-set) which includes `U+002B (+)` and `U+0025 (%)`\n\n1. The first `+` must be escaped (but not the second and third as they come from spaces)\n2. The original `%` is also escaped.\n\nI get `1%2B1+%81%DF+2%2520%26%238253%3B` in my impl",
